  "description": "WPF viewer for Broadside: a PdfView control on the shared viewer core. Tiles render off the UI thread with the fully managed software rasterizer and are composed as frozen bitmaps; mouse, touch, pen and keyboard input, text selection, links, form fields, find-in-document, smart dark mode and UI Automation (pages, their text in reading order, and the tagged structure). Depends on WPF only.",
